  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-01-10T15:51:35.660Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Scripts with different sync behavior modes starts not in the same frame. That makes it impossible to control the order of start in combination with the DefaultExecutionOrder attribute.\n\nExample:\n\n```\n\n[UdonBehaviourSyncMode(UdonSharp.BehaviourSyncMode.None)]\n\npublic class BehaviourSyncModeNone : UdonSharpBehaviour {\n\n}\n\n```\n\nstarts before:\n\n```\n\n[UdonBehaviourSyncMode(UdonSharp.BehaviourSyncMode.Manual)]\n\n[DefaultExecutionOrder(-1000000)]\n\npublic class BehaviourSyncModeManual : UdonSharpBehaviour {\n\n}\n\n```\n\nWorld to reproduce (Bug Booth 1):\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_108e4f73-c158-46c2-9889-660e8fb49889",
